    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Dave Branchaud",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103790873280777669254/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXsbEQjhQHD13XCBQj_-LdL3m-yDFC7UZ3Jo5-jNcTlR0sb-kzV=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Michel was extremely helpful and kind. Great bike shop. I will drive 70km just to come to this shop again. I would give 6 stars if I could. Thanks again!",
        "time": 1754167386,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amanda Shaw",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115686177843781308797/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK2o16dFCJCkOYBmyWUzGvK-qc6OvfzMl8MctzaGWzxQ1fdhg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "I took two bikes in for a tune-up. They were very clear about the amount of time it would take and even finished a day earlier than expected. When I went to pick them up, I decided to buy a better bike rack than the one I had. The associate who was checking me out for the bike repair was very informed about the models, and when I decided to buy one, he immediately installed it on my vehicle and showed me how it worked. Amazing service from knowledgeable technicians!",
        "time": 1747824690,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jennifer Kaszel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112328264155569544788/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVLUHVFHIoWNLqe5et8hMG5mP-R0ut7LCR0h9iJHvYHXVZr1sxVag=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing service!!!! They have helped me with everything from regular pedal bikes, to e-bikes to e-scooters. Very grateful. Thank you 🙏",
        "time": 1760649704,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Linda Elizabeth",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108753476846544254422/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWQpSrBxz84bGMBxrbeq57ovE8yH3LYryHT2Fhw24l91pTBubA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I biked by yesterday because my bike was making a noise, asked if I needed an appointment, Gaétane came outside brought my bike in…..played around with it for a few minutes, and fixed the noise. I asked how much and he did nothing….ca ne coûte rien pour des conseils. What an amazing place. You do not find places like that around anymore, people that actually care and are there to help you without paying a fortune for repairs.  I also had a flat tire last yet and it was fixed right away, and at a reasonable price..\nMERCI GAETANE! You guys are fantastic!!🥰",
        "time": 1751395468,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lorenzo Arena",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105554969178292854040/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWMr-fwQB2VNRe4l46FE11fXxRKsDtaPh_MS5GgO6iiidem0BkE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing service . I had a flat tire on my bicycle , The tire was fixed in less then 10 minutes and the price was also not expensive .\nThank you for the great service :)",
        "time": 1753110071,
        "translated": false
      }
